{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "def comb_sort(elements: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Sorts a list of elements in ascending order using the Comb Sort algorithm.\n    The sort is performed in-place.\"\"\"\n    n = len(elements)\n    if n <= 1:\n        return elements\n\n    gap = n\n    shrink_factor = 1.3\n    swapped = True\n\n    while gap > 1 or swapped:\n        # Update the gap value for the next pass\n        gap = int(gap / shrink_factor)\n        if gap < 1:\n            gap = 1\n\n        swapped = False\n        # Perform a \"bubble sort\" pass for the current gap\n        for i in range(n - gap):\n            if elements[i] > elements[i + gap]:\n                elements[i], elements[i + gap] = elements[i + gap], elements[i]\n                swapped = True\n    return elements"}
