{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(numbers: list[int]) -> float:\n  \"\"\"Calculates the ratio of zero elements to non-zero elements in an array of integers.\n\n  Returns 0.0 if there are no non-zero elements to avoid division by zero.\n  \"\"\"\n  zero_count = 0\n  non_zero_count = 0\n\n  for element in numbers:\n      if element == 0:\n          zero_count += 1\n      else:\n          non_zero_count += 1\n\n  if non_zero_count == 0:\n      return 0.0\n  else:\n      return float(zero_count) / non_zero_count"}
