{"task_id": "Mbpp/555", "solution": "def difference(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the difference between the sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers\n    and the sum of the first n natural numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input 'n' must be a natural number (positive integer).\")\n\n    # Calculate sum of first n natural numbers: n * (n + 1) / 2\n    sum_n = n * (n + 1) // 2\n\n    # Calculate sum of cubes of first n natural numbers: (n * (n + 1) / 2)^2\n    sum_cubes_n = sum_n * sum_n\n\n    # Calculate the difference\n    diff_value = sum_cubes_n - sum_n\n\n    return diff_value"}
